{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_13","type":"agent_message","text":"I found the main defect: checkout decrements inventory by `OrderProduct.id` instead of the ordered product, and it only logs shortages after creating the order. I’m fixing that path, then adding a shared 409 stock-conflict response and guarding every cart mutation before persistence."}}
